  - question: What is isotretinoin?
    answer: >-
      It is a strong tablet for severe acne, prescribed only by a skin
      specialist. It works very well for many people, but can cause side
      effects, including dry skin and, rarely, mood changes. It can seriously
      harm an unborn baby, so a pregnancy prevention programme is needed.
